wf-company-ashfall-reavers-description = The Ashfall Reavers are what became of the mining crews, deserters and debtors the Colossus sector chewed up and spat out. They fly patched-together hulls out of hidden anchorages in the ash belts, take what moves and cannot shoot back, and sell it on to anyone who does not ask. Both navies shoot them on sight; the Reavers return the favour.
